WEBVTT

01:30.340 --> 01:33.578
=Against The Current=

01:33.579 --> 01:35.000
(Adapted from He Yanshan's novel,
Orchid Fragrance Fate)

01:35.180 --> 01:36.920
=Episode 3=
(This drama does not correspond)

01:36.930 --> 01:38.200
(to any real historical dynasty.)

01:38.210 --> 01:41.110
(The systems, culture, attire and other
dynastic elements have been adapted.)

02:31.599 --> 02:32.319
Father.

02:36.960 --> 02:38.240
Now that you're back,

02:38.800 --> 02:40.840
you should rein in
that boorish behavior of yours.

02:42.080 --> 02:44.159
This is not
that filthy military camp of yours.

02:45.759 --> 02:47.080
I care about my parents.

02:47.256 --> 02:49.400
I rushed back
the moment I received my transfer order.

02:50.560 --> 02:53.680
Now that I've seen
how energetic you are, Father,

02:54.639 --> 02:55.639
I'm relieved.

02:56.680 --> 02:58.039
I still need to greet Mother,

02:59.240 --> 03:00.319
so I'll be leaving.

03:18.020 --> 03:22.020
(Lin Family, Rongzhang House)

03:24.080 --> 03:25.360
Greetings, Mother.

03:28.216 --> 03:29.520
I'm glad that you've returned.

03:30.120 --> 03:31.240
I'm so glad.

03:32.540 --> 03:35.000
(Qin Shunhua, Lin Jinqi's Mother,
Lin Family's First Madam)

03:35.000 --> 03:35.759
Hurry.

03:36.120 --> 03:37.199
Let me take a look.

03:37.759 --> 03:38.280
Come.

03:43.719 --> 03:45.199
Have you lost weight?

03:57.919 --> 03:58.759
Qi.

04:00.800 --> 04:02.080
You've suffered.

04:04.400 --> 04:05.360
I got scratched

04:05.360 --> 04:06.680
when I was cleaning the weapons.

04:07.439 --> 04:08.680
It only looks scary.

04:12.319 --> 04:13.000
Are you sure?

04:14.319 --> 04:16.439
I'd never dare lie to you, Mother.

04:18.720 --> 04:20.319
You were gone for six years.

04:20.800 --> 04:22.120
Finally, you're back.

04:26.000 --> 04:28.120
From now on, I want you by my side,

04:28.600 --> 04:30.480
living your life with your wife.

04:31.360 --> 04:33.000
Give birth to children soon.

04:33.560 --> 04:34.160
Then,

04:34.839 --> 04:36.600
both our families will be at ease.

04:41.800 --> 04:43.120
It's all thanks to Old Master Zhao

04:43.959 --> 04:45.519
that you no longer have to fight.

04:45.639 --> 04:46.720
You get to return to Jinling

04:47.319 --> 04:48.360
and even get a promotion.

04:51.199 --> 04:53.360
When you see your wife later,

04:53.800 --> 04:55.199
say a few gentle words to her.

04:57.800 --> 04:58.720
You are right, Mother.

05:03.540 --> 05:09.660
(Lin Family's Zhichun Hall)

05:28.660 --> 05:32.540
(Zhao Xingtang, Lin Jinqi's Wife)

05:36.000 --> 05:36.680
Young Madam,

05:37.404 --> 05:39.279
Young Master has returned.

05:39.928 --> 05:41.260
(Qingxiang)
Judging by the time,

05:41.368 --> 05:43.360
he should probably
arrive in Zhichun Hall by now.

05:43.360 --> 05:44.248
(Zhao Xingtang's Head Maid)

05:45.360 --> 05:46.480
That's his business.

05:48.879 --> 05:51.680
Should I go out
and kneel to welcome him?

05:51.870 --> 05:54.104
I dare not trouble you, Young Lady Zhao.

05:55.096 --> 05:56.728
- Young Master.
- Young Master.

06:07.040 --> 06:07.839
Young Master.

06:40.600 --> 06:41.800
Young Master, you're back.

06:43.199 --> 06:44.439
I haven't congratulated you

06:45.680 --> 06:46.759
on getting your promotion

06:47.120 --> 06:48.079
to a top position.

06:51.560 --> 06:52.759
Young Lady Zhao,

06:53.519 --> 06:55.920
when did you learn
to be so pretentious?

06:57.000 --> 06:58.639
Why not behave like you used to?

06:59.600 --> 07:02.800
We'll be direct and upfront.

07:04.879 --> 07:06.279
I'm more used to that.

07:22.759 --> 07:23.879
As expected of Young Master,

07:23.880 --> 07:25.480
who has become
the assistant commander.

07:26.600 --> 07:28.480
You're acting so mighty now.

07:30.319 --> 07:31.720
However,

07:32.959 --> 07:34.199
when the Lin family

07:34.800 --> 07:37.600
came rushing to beg the Zhao family
for a marriage back then,

07:39.600 --> 07:41.079
why didn't I see you

07:42.319 --> 07:43.800
acting all high and mighty?

07:48.199 --> 07:49.480
If you have the time,

07:50.199 --> 07:53.000
you should advise
the Zhao family's Old Master

07:54.680 --> 07:56.720
not to be so greedy.

07:57.319 --> 07:58.480
I dared

07:59.199 --> 08:01.480
to join the army back then

08:02.408 --> 08:03.480
because I didn't want

08:03.480 --> 08:05.959
to become a puppet of the Zhao family.

08:11.120 --> 08:12.800
A mere assistant commander

08:12.800 --> 08:14.680
made me transfer
from Jinzhou back to Jinling.

08:15.079 --> 08:17.199
Do you still expect me

08:18.079 --> 08:19.560
to be grateful to the Zhao family?

08:20.439 --> 08:20.920
You...

08:24.839 --> 08:26.879
Whenever you want a divorce,

08:27.720 --> 08:28.959
just tell me.

08:30.000 --> 08:33.559
I will send you away with a parade.

08:44.799 --> 08:46.200
You ingrate!

08:47.360 --> 08:48.879
If it weren't for the Zhao family,

08:49.320 --> 08:51.840
the Lin family would've shared
the same fate as the Shen family!

08:52.840 --> 08:54.600
Trying to burn bridges now?

08:55.759 --> 08:56.919
Dream on!

09:14.980 --> 09:19.740
(Lin Family's Sanjue Hall,
Lin Jinqi's External Study)

09:22.039 --> 09:22.720
Young Master.

09:24.879 --> 09:25.679
The head butler

09:26.184 --> 09:27.550
has been waiting for a while.

09:30.320 --> 09:31.120
Mr. Yang.

09:31.720 --> 09:32.360
Young Master.

09:33.759 --> 09:36.440
I called you as soon as I returned

09:38.080 --> 09:39.399
because I've missed you

09:39.958 --> 09:41.292
and wanted to greet you in person.

09:42.408 --> 09:43.720
Thank you for remembering me.

09:47.639 --> 09:48.480
The second reason

09:49.639 --> 09:51.480
is that Zhichun Hall's maids

09:52.000 --> 09:53.200
seem unfamiliar to me.

09:53.928 --> 09:56.670
If I know what was going on,
I can still see it's the Lin Residence.

09:58.204 --> 09:59.240
If I didn't,

09:59.768 --> 10:02.504
I would've thought that
I'd wandered into the Zhao Residence.

10:09.639 --> 10:10.879
After you joined the army,

10:10.936 --> 10:12.712
the Young Madam
took charge of the household.

10:12.879 --> 10:14.600
The maids who used to serve you

10:14.879 --> 10:16.000
were getting old.

10:16.799 --> 10:19.080
Young Madam said
they might have other ideas

10:19.360 --> 10:20.879
and no longer be loyal,

10:20.920 --> 10:22.150
so she either got them married,

10:22.320 --> 10:24.240
or sold them off to others.

10:27.679 --> 10:28.519
Where's Yuchan?

10:31.679 --> 10:32.559
Young Madam

10:32.960 --> 10:35.080
married Yuchan off to the youngest son

10:35.360 --> 10:36.840
of the head shopkeeper
of the rice shop, Liu.

10:38.159 --> 10:40.279
Isn't the head shopkeeper
of the rice shop

10:41.240 --> 10:42.360
called Wang?

10:44.120 --> 10:46.600
Shopkeeper Wang made a mistake

10:46.919 --> 10:48.480
and was punished by Young Madam.

10:48.759 --> 10:50.399
The second shopkeeper, Liu,

10:51.320 --> 10:52.639
was promoted.

10:55.080 --> 10:57.080
I remember
the youngest son of the Liu family

10:59.240 --> 11:00.480
was a fool.

11:04.919 --> 11:05.720
Yes.

11:23.960 --> 11:25.200
What are you doing?

11:26.039 --> 11:26.840
Get up.

11:27.080 --> 11:27.879
Stand.

11:33.039 --> 11:34.559
Now that I'm back,

11:35.639 --> 11:36.799
Zhichun Hall

11:37.656 --> 11:38.790
belongs to the Lin family.

11:41.679 --> 11:42.879
I understand.

11:49.759 --> 11:51.000
It smells amazing.

11:55.600 --> 11:57.960
I heard your father
bought another painting yesterday.

11:58.270 --> 11:59.550
He received

11:59.688 --> 12:01.200
quite a handsome reward this year.

12:12.279 --> 12:13.799
He just got lucky.

12:13.870 --> 12:15.064
Why is she acting so arrogant?

12:17.879 --> 12:18.919
She gets to eat meat.

12:19.000 --> 12:20.120
Of course, she's arrogant.

12:22.679 --> 12:23.519
All right.

12:24.399 --> 12:24.960
I've talked

12:24.960 --> 12:26.840
to Liu, the second shopkeeper
of the fabric shop.

12:26.879 --> 12:27.990
After the Chinese New Year,

12:28.240 --> 12:29.720
he will ask for his master's blessing

12:29.879 --> 12:31.480
to marry you to his eldest son.

12:35.544 --> 12:36.440
When the time comes,

12:36.440 --> 12:37.919
you'll get to stay in a big house

12:38.039 --> 12:39.440
and eat meat every day.

12:41.320 --> 12:42.440
Don't forget

12:42.639 --> 12:43.960
to take care of me, your mother.

12:49.519 --> 12:50.279
Mother.

13:01.519 --> 13:02.279
This...

13:03.240 --> 13:03.960
The reward

13:03.960 --> 13:05.039
from yesterday's painting?

13:09.799 --> 13:11.039
It's all thanks to Lanxiang

13:11.120 --> 13:13.490
for teaching me how to verify
the authenticity of paintings.

13:13.519 --> 13:14.799
I didn't make a mistake.

13:15.360 --> 13:16.840
Father, it's because you are smart

13:16.840 --> 13:18.039
and use what I taught you.

13:18.200 --> 13:18.559
Here.

13:20.440 --> 13:21.799
Let me show you.

13:28.639 --> 13:29.639
If this goes on,

13:29.639 --> 13:30.840
will we have made enough

13:31.039 --> 13:32.759
to redeem our whole family

13:33.240 --> 13:34.919
in another couple of years?

13:35.559 --> 13:36.360
Probably.

13:39.279 --> 13:41.039
Once we are no longer slaves,

13:41.624 --> 13:43.600
we will find you
a good family to marry into.

13:46.279 --> 13:48.679
Then, your father and I
will not be embarrassed

13:49.080 --> 13:51.480
when we meet your biological mother
in the underworld.

13:55.879 --> 13:56.639
That's enough.

13:58.200 --> 13:59.080
That's enough.

13:59.480 --> 14:00.240
Let's eat.

14:00.320 --> 14:00.799
Yes.

14:02.679 --> 14:03.240
Here.

14:03.759 --> 14:06.240
You are still growing.

14:07.360 --> 14:08.159
Eat more.

14:09.200 --> 14:09.720
Eat.

14:12.080 --> 14:12.759
Father.

14:13.799 --> 14:14.480
Here.

14:14.919 --> 14:16.039
Take one.

14:17.559 --> 14:19.039
- You, too.
- I don't want it.

14:20.879 --> 14:21.759
I'm young.

14:22.159 --> 14:23.120
I'll get a wing.

14:23.416 --> 14:25.480
I still need to spread my wings
and soar higher.

14:28.120 --> 14:28.759
All right.

14:29.080 --> 14:30.799
Let's accept her blessing.

14:31.559 --> 14:34.320
We'll let her
bring our family to greater heights.

14:36.720 --> 14:37.519
I'll eat a leg.

14:37.559 --> 14:38.360
Eating a leg

14:38.440 --> 14:39.399
makes me run faster

14:39.960 --> 14:41.480
so I can catch up to you two.

14:42.919 --> 14:43.320
Eat.

14:52.679 --> 14:54.039
Orders from the head butler.

14:54.670 --> 14:56.568
Everyone, come out
and listen to his orders.

15:10.320 --> 15:11.879
Orders from the head butler.

15:12.664 --> 15:14.640
(Han Dongqing, Madam Qin's Housekeeper)
Every daughter

15:14.759 --> 15:16.559
who has reached the age of 14

15:16.879 --> 15:18.759
and is yet to marry someone

15:19.112 --> 15:21.120
must enter the residence
and work as servants.

15:26.660 --> 15:29.900
(Lv Er, Lv Ji'er's Father)

15:31.279 --> 15:32.240
Madam,

15:32.279 --> 15:33.279
why are they

15:33.480 --> 15:35.320
summoning the daughters
into the residence?

15:36.120 --> 15:37.320
This is the master's order.

15:37.360 --> 15:38.519
You're just a slave.

15:38.520 --> 15:40.232
Why are you asking so many questions?

15:46.320 --> 15:47.320
Lv Ji'er.

15:50.759 --> 15:51.559
Yes.

15:57.840 --> 15:58.759
Xu Lanxiang.

16:22.759 --> 16:23.600
Both of you,

16:23.639 --> 16:24.519
get ready.

16:24.879 --> 16:25.759
Tomorrow morning,

16:25.840 --> 16:27.200
I'll come and pick you two up.

16:29.559 --> 16:30.480
- Dear!
- Mother!

16:30.960 --> 16:31.799
- Dear!
- Mother!

16:37.039 --> 16:38.720
Lanxiang must not enter the residence.

16:39.440 --> 16:40.279
Otherwise,

16:40.312 --> 16:43.048
I'll be too embarrassed to meet
her biological mother in the future.

16:51.360 --> 16:52.080
Mother,

16:52.360 --> 16:53.480
calm down.

16:53.759 --> 16:55.440
There's another way.

16:56.039 --> 16:57.720
What alternative is there?

16:59.799 --> 17:00.600
I think

17:00.720 --> 17:02.840
the master summoning people
into the residence

17:02.960 --> 17:04.039
is a strange move.

17:05.432 --> 17:06.310
Logically speaking,

17:06.359 --> 17:07.960
families like the Lin family

17:08.039 --> 17:10.440
have rules when they pick servants.

17:11.079 --> 17:12.359
They won't

17:12.440 --> 17:13.559
suddenly issue an order

17:13.880 --> 17:16.519
and only summon ladies
who have come of age.

17:16.880 --> 17:18.599
She's right.

17:19.319 --> 17:21.119
In the past,

17:21.559 --> 17:23.559
if someone wants to send their daughters

17:23.559 --> 17:24.920
into the residence,

17:25.559 --> 17:27.359
they have to pay

17:27.440 --> 17:29.079
the madam.

17:30.720 --> 17:31.720
No matter what,

17:32.039 --> 17:33.440
there's one type of person

17:33.880 --> 17:35.279
that the Lin family will not accept.

17:35.960 --> 17:37.920
Which kind?

17:39.400 --> 17:40.720
The ones with an illness.

17:43.720 --> 17:45.519
Why did I forget about this?

17:46.680 --> 17:47.559
Let me tell you.

17:49.359 --> 17:50.640
Find someone

17:50.720 --> 17:52.839
to pay some money

17:52.920 --> 17:54.079
to the madam.

17:54.319 --> 17:55.440
Ask her to report

17:55.559 --> 17:57.880
Lanxiang's illness,

17:57.944 --> 17:59.448
so she cannot enter the residence.

17:59.960 --> 18:02.079
I'll ask the head shopkeeper
to plead for us right away.

18:02.519 --> 18:04.039
I'm sure the head shopkeeper knows her.

18:04.480 --> 18:05.200
Go.

18:06.839 --> 18:07.440
Money.

18:07.480 --> 18:08.240
Money.

18:09.480 --> 18:10.079
Lanxiang.

18:10.440 --> 18:11.720
Help your father take it out.

18:18.279 --> 18:18.920
Take it.

18:19.440 --> 18:20.200
Let me tell you.

18:20.200 --> 18:21.440
We can still make more money,

18:21.496 --> 18:23.310
but Lanxiang
must never enter the residence.

18:23.559 --> 18:24.599
I know.

18:35.960 --> 18:37.119
I've let you down.

18:39.839 --> 18:40.559
Mom.

18:41.319 --> 18:43.200
Don't say such a thing ever again.

18:44.960 --> 18:47.279
You and Father gave me a new life.

18:48.640 --> 18:49.799
Even if I die,

18:50.440 --> 18:52.160
I will never let you enter the residence

18:52.480 --> 18:53.480
to serve others.

18:54.440 --> 18:55.240
Mother.

18:56.119 --> 18:57.680
I'm not afraid of doing that.

18:58.720 --> 19:00.480
I can do anything now.

19:01.440 --> 19:02.720
Don't worry.

19:08.359 --> 19:09.480
Drink your medicine.

19:10.264 --> 19:11.680
The temperature is just right.

19:35.039 --> 19:36.079
So pretty.

19:36.680 --> 19:37.680
With this face of yours,

19:38.000 --> 19:39.799
as long as you stay smart
in the residence,

19:40.039 --> 19:42.079
there'll surely be
a man who fancies you.

19:43.880 --> 19:44.759
When the time comes,

19:44.920 --> 19:46.559
you'll be able to dress fancily

19:46.568 --> 19:48.248
like the other women in the residence.

19:48.839 --> 19:51.319
You'll even have a maid serving you
when you go out.

19:54.440 --> 19:56.024
When you finally live a good life,

19:56.072 --> 19:58.740
don't forget to put in a good word
for both your younger brothers.

20:02.000 --> 20:02.680
Quick, lie down.

20:06.960 --> 20:07.640
It'll be fine.

20:10.079 --> 20:11.480
Have you prepared everything?

20:11.599 --> 20:12.680
There's no problem, right?

20:12.720 --> 20:14.079
Don't worry.

20:14.100 --> 20:15.820
When I told the head shopkeeper
last night,

20:16.000 --> 20:17.079
he agreed to help

20:17.160 --> 20:18.240
immediately.

20:18.480 --> 20:20.359
He said he was close to Madam Han

20:20.480 --> 20:22.240
and even took all the money.

20:22.680 --> 20:23.680
Since he took our money,

20:23.680 --> 20:25.119
nothing will go wrong.

20:38.119 --> 20:39.640
Everyone, wake up! Wake up!

20:41.160 --> 20:41.960
Mother.

20:43.240 --> 20:44.400
Madam Han is here.

20:44.680 --> 20:45.119
Go outside.

20:45.119 --> 20:45.880
Hurry.

20:46.296 --> 20:47.680
I'll carry your things for you.

20:50.360 --> 20:51.590
Both of you, stop playing.

20:54.559 --> 20:55.599
Madam,

20:55.759 --> 20:57.440
please take good care of Ji'er.

21:02.359 --> 21:03.440
Has she left?

21:04.680 --> 21:06.200
I think she'll leave soon.

21:18.799 --> 21:19.640
Xu Lanxiang.

21:31.240 --> 21:32.119
Xu Lanxiang.

21:32.359 --> 21:33.680
It's time to leave.

21:36.680 --> 21:37.720
What's going on?

21:50.480 --> 21:51.519
Why isn't she out yet?

21:51.560 --> 21:52.480
She's coming out.

21:58.559 --> 21:59.440
Madam.

21:59.480 --> 22:00.240
Hurry

22:00.359 --> 22:01.400
and call your daughter out.

22:01.480 --> 22:03.200
Don't waste everyone else's time.

22:04.839 --> 22:05.400
Madam,

22:05.680 --> 22:07.799
can we speak in private?

22:17.039 --> 22:18.039
Madam, look.

22:19.279 --> 22:20.759
My daughter is ill.

22:21.480 --> 22:22.799
She's not fit

22:22.880 --> 22:25.079
to enter the residence
in her current condition.

22:26.279 --> 22:28.000
She looked fine yesterday.

22:28.160 --> 22:29.680
Why did she get ill all of a sudden?

22:30.160 --> 22:31.759
I heard people say

22:31.839 --> 22:34.200
that both of you
care about your daughter a lot,

22:34.360 --> 22:35.920
but she's just entering the residence

22:36.000 --> 22:37.839
and is not going to die.

22:38.160 --> 22:40.119
Since Lanxiang is pretty

22:40.279 --> 22:41.640
and has a nice character,

22:41.688 --> 22:43.920
she might get lucky
and improve her life in the future.

22:44.079 --> 22:44.880
Madam,

22:45.160 --> 22:46.839
my daughter is really ill.

22:46.839 --> 22:48.680
She cannot enter the residence.

22:49.599 --> 22:50.400
Well...

22:51.759 --> 22:54.160
Didn't the head shopkeeper...

22:55.039 --> 22:57.240
What are you talking about?

22:57.839 --> 22:59.759
I still need to pick up others.

22:59.839 --> 23:00.799
Hurry up.

23:01.039 --> 23:02.480
Don't waste time.

23:03.640 --> 23:04.839
You took our money

23:05.576 --> 23:07.640
and still ask my daughter
to enter the residence?

23:08.440 --> 23:10.000
Are you out of your mind?

23:10.440 --> 23:12.200
When did I take your money?

23:13.240 --> 23:15.079
Everyone is listening.

23:15.079 --> 23:17.160
Don't simply accuse me.

23:17.880 --> 23:20.119
If I don't take your daughter away,

23:20.440 --> 23:22.000
my reputation

23:22.000 --> 23:23.160
will be ruined.

23:23.640 --> 23:24.119
Go.

23:24.440 --> 23:25.359
Drag her out.

23:25.519 --> 23:25.759
Yes.

23:26.039 --> 23:26.920
This guy...

23:28.279 --> 23:29.039
No!

23:29.759 --> 23:30.559
No!

23:32.079 --> 23:32.720
Mother.

23:33.680 --> 23:34.839
Mother, listen to me.

23:34.840 --> 23:36.820
Something must have gone wrong
with the head shopkeeper.

23:36.839 --> 23:38.119
Father was scammed.

23:38.168 --> 23:40.200
When someone bullies him,
he won't make a noise.

23:40.240 --> 23:41.400
If they bully us,

23:41.440 --> 23:42.839
he will surely not forgive them.

23:44.079 --> 23:44.720
Xu Lanxiang!

23:45.928 --> 23:46.960
Come out immediately!

23:47.119 --> 23:48.079
Madam,

23:48.160 --> 23:48.880
listen to me.

23:48.920 --> 23:50.319
She is still taking medicine.

23:50.480 --> 23:51.960
She does have a...

23:53.599 --> 23:54.079
No!

23:54.216 --> 23:55.352
Mother!

23:55.380 --> 23:56.519
- Madam.
- Persuade Father.

23:56.519 --> 23:57.839
Madam.

23:58.720 --> 23:59.480
Lanxiang!

23:59.880 --> 24:01.240
- Lanxiang!
- Lanxiang!

24:03.039 --> 24:03.599
Father!

24:03.640 --> 24:04.799
Let go of my daughter!

24:05.160 --> 24:05.799
Lanxiang

24:05.920 --> 24:07.000
has an illness.

24:07.010 --> 24:08.190
- She can't enter the residence.
- Let go of my daughter!

24:08.200 --> 24:09.279
She will spread the illness
to the residence!

24:09.319 --> 24:10.360
Don't do this. Don't be stupid.

24:10.376 --> 24:11.400
Father, calm down.

24:11.440 --> 24:12.232
It's my first time

24:12.264 --> 24:14.680
seeing someone like you
who doesn't know your place.

24:15.039 --> 24:16.799
I'm telling you.

24:16.960 --> 24:19.200
This is an order
from the butler himself.

24:19.210 --> 24:20.920
Anyone who dares to go against the order

24:21.079 --> 24:22.519
will be sold!

24:22.799 --> 24:24.119
You can't take my daughter away!

24:24.120 --> 24:25.304
Madam, you've misunderstood.

24:25.680 --> 24:26.519
I'll go with you.

24:27.039 --> 24:28.799
Please let me say a few words
to my parents.

24:29.160 --> 24:29.960
Cut the nonsense.

24:30.030 --> 24:30.600
Take her away.

24:32.140 --> 24:33.160
You can't take her away!

24:33.160 --> 24:34.039
Father, calm down.

24:34.519 --> 24:35.599
- I'll be fine.
- Enough!

24:35.680 --> 24:37.359
- Take her away!
- Don't take her away!

24:37.480 --> 24:38.820
- Father, calm down.
- Lanxiang!

24:38.839 --> 24:39.799
I'll be fine!

24:40.200 --> 24:42.160
- I'll be fine!
- Don't take my daughter away!

24:42.270 --> 24:44.424
- Go.
- Don't take my daughter away!

24:45.079 --> 24:46.079
Take care.

24:47.079 --> 24:47.720
Go.

24:47.799 --> 24:48.599
Lanxiang!

24:49.480 --> 24:50.839
Does your family have a death wish?

24:51.200 --> 24:51.920
Madam.

24:54.880 --> 24:55.759
Lanxiang!

24:55.880 --> 24:56.680
Madam.

24:57.240 --> 24:58.039
Madam.

24:58.039 --> 24:58.759
Lanxiang!

24:58.920 --> 25:00.160
Madam, don't be sad.

25:00.319 --> 25:01.039
Lanxiang

25:01.079 --> 25:02.200
is a lovable child.

25:02.240 --> 25:03.279
She will be fine.

25:04.119 --> 25:05.079
She will be fine.

25:08.559 --> 25:10.240
What have you done?

25:11.720 --> 25:14.000
Didn't you get everything ready?

25:16.119 --> 25:18.240
What's going on?

25:19.119 --> 25:20.079
He lied to me.

25:21.119 --> 25:22.640
They lied to me!

25:24.000 --> 25:26.720
How dare they harm my daughter?

25:36.079 --> 25:36.640
Xu.

25:36.872 --> 25:37.688
Don't come near!

25:37.690 --> 25:39.640
Put down the knife.
Why is he taking the knife?

25:39.680 --> 25:40.780
Is he going to kill someone?

25:40.799 --> 25:42.720
Lanxiang told me to stop her father.

25:43.160 --> 25:43.640
I...

25:47.440 --> 25:47.960
Madam.

25:48.599 --> 25:49.240
Wujiu!

25:49.480 --> 25:49.960
Liu Wujiu,

25:49.960 --> 25:51.319
come and help!

25:53.759 --> 25:55.480
Anything is worth something.

25:55.960 --> 25:57.720
It does help us financially.

25:58.079 --> 25:59.240
Indeed.

26:02.359 --> 26:04.000
If he comes back,

26:05.000 --> 26:07.400
you must settle the accounts.

26:11.920 --> 26:12.640
Head Shopkeeper,

26:13.400 --> 26:14.000
do you think

26:14.640 --> 26:17.759
Xu Wanquan will come and cause trouble?

26:18.920 --> 26:20.720
He's nothing to be scared of.

26:20.839 --> 26:22.440
I don't think he's that brave.

26:27.359 --> 26:27.920
You...

26:29.680 --> 26:30.440
What are you doing?

26:30.960 --> 26:32.519
You harmed my daughter.

26:32.839 --> 26:35.720
I'll kill you
even at the cost of my life!

26:43.119 --> 26:43.880
Madam.

26:46.799 --> 26:48.160
I want to go back for a while.

26:49.519 --> 26:51.039
Not only am I worried about my father,

26:51.310 --> 26:53.128
but I'm also doing it
to ease your burden.

26:55.480 --> 26:56.880
Help me ease my burden?

26:58.640 --> 27:00.119
My father is an honest man.

27:00.400 --> 27:01.440
You are wise, Madam.

27:01.559 --> 27:02.960
I'm sure you've guessed

27:03.200 --> 27:04.599
that my father got scammed.

27:04.640 --> 27:07.039
He might kill someone.

27:08.200 --> 27:10.559
What does that have to do with me?

27:11.400 --> 27:13.039
If my father ends up killing someone,

27:15.359 --> 27:17.279
he will surely drag you into this.

27:19.559 --> 27:22.039
Madam, you are honest and innocent.

27:22.319 --> 27:23.920
But I'm sure you've heard

27:24.039 --> 27:26.440
the saying that rumors are scary.

27:26.920 --> 27:28.200
The bystanders

27:28.400 --> 27:30.799
and people who dislike you

27:30.960 --> 27:32.680
will not verify the truth.

27:32.799 --> 27:35.160
They will only make the rumors worse

27:35.200 --> 27:36.680
and ruin your reputation.

27:39.799 --> 27:42.279
Someone! Hurry!

27:42.319 --> 27:43.720
He's trying to kill me! Someone!

27:43.799 --> 27:45.839
Murder!

27:46.039 --> 27:47.000
Murder!

27:47.319 --> 27:48.079
Someone, hurry!

27:48.079 --> 27:48.880
I'll kill you!

27:49.440 --> 27:50.119
Someone!

27:59.839 --> 28:00.519
It's fine now.

28:00.559 --> 28:01.359
It's fine now.

28:02.000 --> 28:03.160
Let go of me!

28:03.720 --> 28:05.079
You harmed my daughter

28:05.200 --> 28:06.759
and scammed me out of my money!

28:06.799 --> 28:08.359
I'm going to kill you!

28:09.720 --> 28:10.519
Xu Wanquan!

28:11.039 --> 28:12.240
Don't spout nonsense!

28:12.640 --> 28:13.559
Tell me.

28:13.960 --> 28:15.960
Which piece of silver here
belongs to you?

28:17.200 --> 28:20.839
Those are
our family's hard-earned money.

28:23.160 --> 28:24.400
Xu Wanquan.

28:25.440 --> 28:29.319
You've been the third shopkeeper
for too long

28:30.160 --> 28:32.720
and forgotten
that you're a slave, right?

28:33.519 --> 28:36.000
Every shirt you wear

28:36.000 --> 28:36.920
and every bite you eat

28:36.920 --> 28:38.240
belongs to your master.

28:38.559 --> 28:40.240
You have no personal assets.

28:40.760 --> 28:41.590
Even if you do,

28:41.680 --> 28:43.240
it still belongs to your master.

28:44.079 --> 28:45.000
Nonsense!

28:46.960 --> 28:47.880
Two years ago,

28:48.240 --> 28:49.920
Shopkeeper Wang from the rice shop

28:50.039 --> 28:52.039
also thought the whole business

28:52.119 --> 28:53.400
was his own.

28:55.000 --> 28:56.440
A simple word from Young Madam

28:56.920 --> 28:58.759
made him poor.

28:59.079 --> 29:00.880
His whole family was sold off.

29:03.000 --> 29:03.880
I am a slave,

29:04.440 --> 29:05.480
but so are you.

29:06.079 --> 29:08.000
You scammed me out of my money.

29:08.079 --> 29:10.240
I'm going to report you
to the officials!

29:12.480 --> 29:13.480
Come here.

29:14.359 --> 29:15.039
Go.

29:15.200 --> 29:17.240
Go and make a report.

29:17.400 --> 29:18.920
See if the officials

29:19.119 --> 29:21.279
will return your money.

29:21.944 --> 29:23.200
If you're going to report me,

29:23.559 --> 29:25.200
I can report you

29:26.119 --> 29:27.519
for attempting murder.

29:27.519 --> 29:29.279
Your crime is unforgivable.

29:30.200 --> 29:32.039
When you are thrown in prison,

29:32.799 --> 29:33.599
your daughter,

29:33.599 --> 29:36.319
a servant who just joined the residence,

29:37.440 --> 29:38.759
will be defenseless.

29:39.000 --> 29:41.519
We can do whatever we want to her.

29:46.680 --> 29:47.640
Let go of my father.

29:49.480 --> 29:50.359
Let go of him.

29:52.400 --> 29:53.599
Speak of

29:54.200 --> 29:55.640
the devil.

29:56.279 --> 29:56.920
Lanxiang.

29:57.000 --> 29:59.599
Aren't you going into the residence
this morning?

30:00.200 --> 30:00.799
What?

30:00.904 --> 30:02.400
Can't bear to leave your parents?

30:02.880 --> 30:03.799
Lanxiang.

30:05.799 --> 30:07.240
I've let you down.

30:08.640 --> 30:10.200
He scammed me.

30:10.480 --> 30:12.079
Our money...

30:12.759 --> 30:14.960
What are you talking about?

30:15.559 --> 30:17.000
I've said it, right?

30:17.279 --> 30:19.200
Servants can't have personal assets.

30:19.224 --> 30:20.270
I'm returning this money

30:20.759 --> 30:22.240
to our master

30:22.319 --> 30:23.319
so the master

30:23.960 --> 30:24.680
can deal with it.

30:25.079 --> 30:26.519
Head Shopkeeper, you are right.

30:27.912 --> 30:30.260
Although the officials don't care
if we don't make a report,

30:30.279 --> 30:31.160
according to the law,

30:31.319 --> 30:33.440
slaves still can't keep
any personal assets.

30:36.759 --> 30:38.359
You are wiser than your father.

30:38.960 --> 30:39.640
Everyone

30:39.680 --> 30:41.519
saw it clearly today.

30:41.839 --> 30:42.640
Your father

30:43.400 --> 30:45.440
rushed to me with a knife

30:45.559 --> 30:47.559
and claimed he wanted to kill me.

30:47.839 --> 30:50.680
I have witnesses and evidence.

30:51.200 --> 30:52.200
If I send him

30:52.200 --> 30:54.039
to the officials...

30:54.088 --> 30:55.768
Those who assault someone with a weapon,

30:55.799 --> 30:56.880
regardless of the situation,

30:56.950 --> 30:59.112
will be flogged 100 times
and imprisoned for 10 years.

30:59.279 --> 31:01.079
My father attacked someone with a knife.

31:01.480 --> 31:04.079
He should be heavily punished
according to the law.

31:08.400 --> 31:10.160
However, there's another law

31:11.440 --> 31:14.359
saying that when a thief steals,

31:14.599 --> 31:15.480
everyone who benefits,

31:15.559 --> 31:16.640
regardless of status,

31:16.759 --> 31:18.039
will be punished equally.

31:18.279 --> 31:19.839
Those who steal 80 silver

31:20.240 --> 31:21.519
will be hanged.

31:21.880 --> 31:24.039
Slaves who steal their master's assets

31:24.440 --> 31:25.799
will follow this law.

31:30.920 --> 31:32.440
What do you mean?

31:33.640 --> 31:35.400
As the head shopkeeper
of Rongbao Pavilion,

31:35.480 --> 31:37.960
you are even trying
to steal my family's 20 silver.

31:38.079 --> 31:39.680
If you don't lack money,

31:39.759 --> 31:40.559
that means

31:41.559 --> 31:43.640
someone is going to check the accounts.

31:48.799 --> 31:49.359
Shopkeeper...

31:50.680 --> 31:52.720
Just send my father to the officials.

31:52.840 --> 31:53.830
When two slaves argue,

31:53.839 --> 31:55.230
they'll have their own arguments.

31:55.240 --> 31:56.960
The master will surely send someone.

31:57.200 --> 31:58.160
When the time comes,

31:58.440 --> 32:00.480
do you dare explain everything

32:01.799 --> 32:04.599
in front of everyone?

32:15.000 --> 32:16.319
Let go.

32:16.400 --> 32:17.359
Let go!

32:37.640 --> 32:38.039
Lanxiang.

32:38.480 --> 32:40.720
Weren't you taken away by Madam Han?

32:42.359 --> 32:44.000
I pleaded with Madam Han.

32:44.039 --> 32:45.640
She allowed me to come back for a while.

32:54.000 --> 32:55.039
Don't worry, Father.

32:55.720 --> 32:57.160
After I enter the residence,

32:58.119 --> 32:59.279
I'll be fine.

32:59.920 --> 33:01.599
You and Mother have to take care.

33:03.291 --> 33:04.720
I'll still say the same thing.

33:07.039 --> 33:09.000
We won't be slaves forever.

33:09.720 --> 33:10.559
One day,

33:10.936 --> 33:12.510
we will be able to redeem ourselves.

33:20.640 --> 33:21.640
Father, my mother

33:22.319 --> 33:24.039
and you must live well.

33:27.480 --> 33:28.200
Otherwise,

33:29.160 --> 33:30.960
I will be alone

33:31.279 --> 33:32.359
in this world.

33:32.920 --> 33:34.440
I won't be able to live on.

33:40.480 --> 33:41.680
I will remember.

33:43.759 --> 33:44.960
I will live well.

33:46.559 --> 33:48.160
All of us must do so.

34:15.639 --> 34:16.760
Lanxiang!

34:31.199 --> 34:31.920
It's fine.

34:32.119 --> 34:33.119
It's fine. Don't worry.

34:41.256 --> 34:45.540
(Glorify the Family Name)

35:33.544 --> 35:35.360
The first person on the left
of the front row

35:35.519 --> 35:37.159
is the third daughter
of the Zhou family,

35:37.199 --> 35:38.239
Zhou Gantang.

35:39.599 --> 35:40.679
The person next to her

35:40.960 --> 35:42.039
is Lv Ji'er.

35:42.039 --> 35:43.400
The third person in the middle

35:43.400 --> 35:44.719
is Du Xiaolian.

35:45.000 --> 35:48.239
The fourth person is Xu Lanxiang.

35:48.960 --> 35:50.360
These four girls

35:50.719 --> 35:52.360
are the prettiest.

36:05.780 --> 36:11.380
(Xu Lanxiang, Lv Ji'er,
Zhou Gantang, Du Xiaolian)

36:14.039 --> 36:14.960
Calm down.

36:15.320 --> 36:16.719
Young Master will be here soon.

36:27.480 --> 36:28.280
Young Master.

36:30.719 --> 36:31.440
Young Master.

36:41.480 --> 36:43.360
You said
you have something urgent to tell me.

36:44.000 --> 36:45.079
Don't tell me

36:46.480 --> 36:48.159
it's to have a reunion dinner with me.

36:49.280 --> 36:50.079
Young Master,

36:50.400 --> 36:51.480
try this soup.

36:51.550 --> 36:53.352
Young Madam made it herself.

37:04.480 --> 37:05.079
What is it?

37:05.880 --> 37:06.320
Tell me.

37:10.888 --> 37:13.190
Father organized a banquet today
at the Zhao residence

37:14.159 --> 37:16.000
to welcome you back home.

37:19.920 --> 37:20.960
How unfortunate.

37:21.719 --> 37:23.800
I still need to hand over my duties
at the Garrison.

37:24.848 --> 37:26.527
I appreciate your father's offer,

37:29.792 --> 37:31.151
but I'm afraid I have to decline.

37:33.480 --> 37:34.559
Lin Jinqi!

37:34.880 --> 37:37.360
I came just at the right time.

37:37.480 --> 37:38.239
See?

37:38.320 --> 37:40.440
Young Master and Young Madam
are both here.

37:57.039 --> 37:58.239
Madam Han, you're here?

37:58.480 --> 37:59.599
Please come in.

38:08.119 --> 38:09.320
Stand properly.

38:10.039 --> 38:11.920
Greet Young Master and Young Madam.

38:12.504 --> 38:13.800
- Young Master.
- Young Master.

38:13.920 --> 38:15.080
- Young Madam.
- Young Madam.

38:18.559 --> 38:20.000
There are 12 hereditary slaves

38:20.000 --> 38:21.519
who came of age this time.

38:22.559 --> 38:24.599
First Madam chose these four

38:25.679 --> 38:27.199
and ordered me to bring them

38:27.679 --> 38:29.760
to Zhichun Hall to serve you both.

38:32.119 --> 38:34.119
Please tell First Madam

38:34.296 --> 38:35.550
we appreciate her kindness,

38:35.800 --> 38:37.639
but Zhichun Hall has enough staff.

38:39.000 --> 38:40.119
Young Madam,

38:40.360 --> 38:41.559
First Madam said

38:41.599 --> 38:43.360
it's tough managing the household.

38:43.599 --> 38:45.079
Now that Young Master has returned,

38:45.480 --> 38:46.199
Zhichun Hall

38:46.280 --> 38:48.559
will need more servants.

38:49.119 --> 38:50.480
First Madam

38:50.599 --> 38:51.880
really liked

38:52.159 --> 38:54.360
these four servants'
appearances and personalities.

38:54.480 --> 38:56.880
They are way better
than the previous ones who were rude.

38:57.639 --> 38:59.280
She also mentioned

38:59.639 --> 39:01.239
that Young Master's return

39:01.360 --> 39:02.480
made her

39:02.599 --> 39:04.320
feel at ease.

39:04.800 --> 39:06.440
If she can see

39:06.440 --> 39:08.920
you two giving birth to a few children,

39:09.159 --> 39:10.639
she will be

39:11.039 --> 39:12.679
very relieved.

39:27.480 --> 39:29.119
Since they were picked
by First Madam,

39:31.360 --> 39:33.119
just keep them
and assign them some chores.

40:05.440 --> 40:06.519
What is your name?

40:07.639 --> 40:08.719
What does your family do?

40:08.960 --> 40:09.719
What do you know?

40:09.719 --> 40:10.639
Tell me everything.

40:19.320 --> 40:20.119
My surname is Zhou.

40:20.559 --> 40:21.360
I am Gantang.

40:21.599 --> 40:22.159
How dare you.

40:22.800 --> 40:23.519
How dare you

40:23.519 --> 40:25.000
share the same name as Young Madam?

40:25.320 --> 40:26.159
Slap yourself.

40:28.536 --> 40:29.630
I deserve to be punished!

40:29.710 --> 40:30.904
I deserve to be punished!

40:33.639 --> 40:34.639
From today onward,

40:35.639 --> 40:36.920
your name is Yingge.

40:40.159 --> 40:41.719
Thank you for granting me a name.

40:43.000 --> 40:44.159
Young Madam,

40:44.960 --> 40:47.239
my mother was
First Madam's dowry servant.

40:47.240 --> 40:49.060
(Zhou Gantang (Yingge))
I'm good at gardening,

40:49.079 --> 40:50.280
making pastries,

40:50.800 --> 40:52.159
and making fragrances.

41:07.320 --> 41:08.360
My surname is Du.

41:08.800 --> 41:09.679
My name is Xiaolian.

41:10.159 --> 41:11.159
My father

41:11.160 --> 41:13.260
(Du Xiaolian)
used to serve under the Second Master.

41:13.400 --> 41:14.760
After he passed away,

41:14.960 --> 41:16.880
my mother became a nightsoil collector.

41:17.559 --> 41:19.639
I... I don't know

41:19.639 --> 41:21.119
what I can do.

41:21.920 --> 41:23.800
My mother says I only know how to eat.

41:23.848 --> 41:25.832
Don't be rude
in front of the Young Madam.

41:34.679 --> 41:35.559
My surname is Lv.

41:35.719 --> 41:36.800
My name is Ji'er.

41:37.320 --> 41:39.559
My grandfather was the vice manor head.

41:39.840 --> 41:41.639
I can cook and do laundry.

41:42.039 --> 41:44.159
I raise my younger brothers at home.

41:46.519 --> 41:48.000
I'm also good at embroidery.

41:48.840 --> 41:50.039
Young Madam, look.

41:50.519 --> 41:52.079
I made this pattern.

42:12.159 --> 42:13.119
My surname is Xu.

42:13.239 --> 42:14.159
My name is Lanxiang.

42:15.119 --> 42:17.440
My father is
the third shopkeeper of the curio shop.

42:19.199 --> 42:19.800
I...

42:21.159 --> 42:22.199
Ji'er and I

42:22.199 --> 42:23.880
grew up in the same household.

42:24.119 --> 42:26.800
We usually cook, do laundry,

42:27.599 --> 42:28.760
and embroider together.

42:31.176 --> 42:32.880
This is a handkerchief I embroidered.

42:35.480 --> 42:36.280
That's enough.

42:41.480 --> 42:42.360
Qingxiang.

42:43.559 --> 42:44.679
Take them away

42:45.719 --> 42:47.119
and teach them the rules.

42:48.159 --> 42:50.280
Assign some chores to them.

42:52.360 --> 42:52.920
Yes.

43:05.300 --> 43:07.700
=Against the Current=
(Next Episode's Preview)

43:11.559 --> 43:12.719
Look. What is this?

43:14.360 --> 43:15.199
Money?

43:16.360 --> 43:17.960
You're becoming a bigger fool.

43:18.159 --> 43:20.679
This is money
given to me by Young Master.

43:22.984 --> 43:25.096
You get money
just by delivering him a pot of tea?

43:25.679 --> 43:28.239
Young Master said
I'm capable and quick-witted.

43:31.159 --> 43:32.119
Young Master asked me

43:32.232 --> 43:33.670
why the Young Madam came to our place

43:33.679 --> 43:35.119
in the pouring rain yesterday.

43:35.599 --> 43:37.360
I told him about the sutra.

43:38.360 --> 43:40.880
Now, Young Master
will surely remember my name.

43:42.960 --> 43:45.119
Young Madam also remembers your name.

44:00.620 --> 44:04.740
♪Spring slips from the
branches once more♪

44:07.580 --> 44:12.100
